  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afa79914ee9998e41a40f3558abc89aa, type: 3}
  description: "Goblins are the smallest of the greenskin tribes, shorter than a
    human\u2019s chest, with wiry limbs. They scramble over rocks and ruins with
    frantic, unnaturally fast footwork. Their voices are shrill speech, chattering
    and arguing in high-pitched tongues, often accompanied by mocking laughter and
    rude insults."
